'''Brush''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 5]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is made up of a paintbrush design, hence the name. Imprinted on it is the brush’s black ferule with white streaks on it with bristles attached to it using the colors of the rainbow. The guard and handle are solid black.
